<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Hitachi Zosen 6-months net down.</title>
<headline>Singapore Hitachi Zosen 6-months net down.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to September 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			5.25	vs	6.07</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		  5.00	vs	4.93</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cts)    1.50	vs	1.73</p>
<p>    Turnover			108.36	vs    125.67</p>
<p>    Interest and other income   0.92	vs	0.80</p>
<p>    Interest expense		0.21	vs	0.32</p>
<p>    Depreciation, amortisation  2.87	vs	3.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  7.73	vs	8.43</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (0.28)     vs     (0.19)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		 0.05	vs	nil</p>
<p>Div register/div pay date December 16 1996/ December 30 1996</p>
<p>Note - Ship-repair company Hitachi Zosen Singapore Ltd said the extraordinary gain came from sale and redemption of long-term investments.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom  (65 8703083) at jn</p>
</text>
